cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use PedsCode, please cite it as below."
title: "PedsCode — Childhood Cancer Coding Guide"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Uganda Child Cancer Foundation"
abstract: >-
  An advisory decision tool that helps a cancer registry data abstractor turn
  the clinical language in a patient file into an ICD-O-3.2 morphology code,
  mapped to its group in the International Classification of Childhood
  Cancer, third edition (ICCC-3).
repository-code: "https://github.com/jvarsani-ctrl/ICD-0-3-Codes-Look-up-tool"
url: "https://jvarsani-ctrl.github.io/ICD-0-3-Codes-Look-up-tool/"
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - cancer registry
  - childhood cancer
  - ICD-O-3.2
  - ICCC-3
  - paediatric oncology
